// # oocamera package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oocamera (layers/L5-apps).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oocamera.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oocamera.oo.
